Z||000032||superXmotorsports||06-02-2000||03:20 PM||||For those of you with the backlit style gauges (86-88 V6 models 120MPH speedo) we continue to offer the white and colored SuperSport gauges.  A custom logo or name can be put on the face and will GLOW at night.  Keep in mind though the trip odometer is at the bottom of the speedo in the spot where you show the Pegasus.  They are $89 a set for Forum members and you can get more info at:<BR> <A HREF="http://users.supernet.com/superx/estore" TARGET=_blank>http://users.supernet.com/superx/estore</A> <P>Thanks!<BR>SXM||||reg||1
